@jerodsanto I've added a various `TODO` comments for various things that you'll want to address before making this live.

The avatar list has alternate styles when there are 3 or fewer people. For now, we're only applying this class (and subsequently these styles) on the podcast page itself, not on individual episodes.

Also, we're testing out left aligned content at mobile. Check it out and let me know if you want anything adjusted.
